message: "If you use this software, the variable dictionary, or the example dataset, please cite it as below. To cite the manual itself, see the 'references' entry and preferences/preferred-citation below."
title: "Ethical Reasoning Mapper (ERM): companion materials"
abstract: >-
  R analysis pipeline, machine-readable variable dictionary, and example
  dataset accompanying the Ethical Reasoning Mapper (ERM) coding manual — a
  standardized coding framework for the empirical analysis of ethical
  reasoning expressed in open-ended responses to ethical dilemmas.
type: software
